    "The window enforcement is modeled as a Boolean observable because the report supplies no numeric validUntil/validAfter values.",
    "Only the i_window_not_enforced impact is formalized; other listed impacts are handled in separate passes.",
    "The outside-window execution is described as potential capability, not an observed incident.",
    "The window enforcement relation is encoded as a Boolean because no numeric time bounds are supplied.",
    "The claim formalizes only i_unauthorized_wallet_actions; i_window_not_enforced and i_execute_outside_window are not covered by this plan.",
    "Whether the rewritten window is actually accepted by EntryPoint validation is described as a capability, not an observed incident.",
    "The relayer's status as legitimate bundler versus external attacker is not resolved beyond holding the signed op."
